{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/gocartours-sandiego/items/118469/", "pk": 118469, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/gocartours-sandiego/", "pk": 32820, "shortname": "gocartours-sandiego", "name": "GoCar Tours San Diego", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "IRide Scooter Rentals", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 1, "unicode": "IRide Scooter Rentals", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 0.5, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.5, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 12000, "description": "#*Choose from 1, 2, or 3 hour GPS guided tours or Rentals on our Phat Scooters.*\n\n*(All Scooters Hold 1 Person - 350lb max weight)*\n\n## Duration\n1, 2 and 3 Hours\n\n## About\n\nThis tour or rental is essential for anyone who really wants to get out and really experience San Diego. It takes the best parts of our Downtown, Balboa and Old Town tours, and gives you plenty of time to do all three tours, while also stopping and really checking out the sights of San Diego. You will have more than enough time to stop and tour the Maritime Museum and check out all of the ships, navigate through the unique Horton Plaza mall, and the Gaslamp Quarter to see all the sights of Downtown. From there you can peruse around Balboa park on foot and really take in the sights and sounds of Balboa and even go to one of the many museums that are always open, and stop to smell the roses in our Rose Garden with over 800 different varieties of roses. Lastly you can have a quick bite to eat some authentic Mexican food in Old Town after walking through many of San Diego’s historic buildings, including the original home of the San Diego Union Tribune, but don’t forget to go visit San Diego’s most spooky location, the Whaley House which is officially noted as “America’s Most Haunted House”. All along this tour are many great spots to stop and take pictures, eat, drink, relax and truly experience why San Diego truly is America’s Finest City.\n\n\n##Tour Highlights:\n•\tLittle Italy\n•\tMaritime museum\n•\tU.S.S. Midway\n•\tSeaport Village\n•\tHorton Plaza\n•\tHistoric Gaslamp Quarter\n•\tPetco Park\n•\tBankers Hill\n•\tBalboa Park\n•\tSan Diego Zoo\n•\tHillcrest\n•\tMission Hills\n•\tFort Stockton\n•\tPresidio Park\n•\tOld Town", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "3918 Mason St., San Diego, CA 92110", "booking_notes": "##Please arrive at least 15 min before your scheduled departure time. \n\n-Departure times are approximated due to customers prior to your reservation possibly taking longer than they were booked for.\n\n- If you wish to keep your scooter longer than what you have booked for, you are welcome, but please check that it is available for you to keep and not needed by another renter. \n\n- Additional time is charged in 15 minute increments at our standard internet rates. \n\n- Please make sure you return the scooter before we close. Late returns are billed at $1 per minute. Please check with staff on day of rental the close time of the location. Early returns will not be refunded for unused time.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "1 ,2, or 3 Hours Rentals • Guided tours or Rental